{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01RTRBGs8B2j2KJJs54AFHxw", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.goodnewsfromindonesia.id/2026/07/11/jage-telok-buaya-permainan-tradisional-dari-kalimantan-barat-yang-meniru-kebiasaan-buaya\"}, {\"url\": \"https://repository.ubb.ac.id/id/eprint/110/8/Lampiran.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.britannica.com/topic/Kubu\"}, {\"url\": \"https://smujo.id/psnmbi/article/download/2605/2271/3442\"}, {\"url\": \"https://journal.ipb.ac.id/j-agrokreatif/article/download/61841/33623/410683\"}, {\"url\": \"https://e-journal.unmas.ac.id/index.php/pemantik/article/download/7420/5624\"}, {\"url\": \"https://e-journal.unmas.ac.id/index.php/pemantik/article/view/7420\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.goodnewsfromindonesia.id/2025/02/05/menuba-ikan-tradisi-suku-dayak-tomun-yang-menggunakan-racun-akar-tuba\"}, {\"url\": \"https://journal.ugm.ac.id/JML/article/download/18517/11810\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:10:51.303Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Suku Kubu alat tradisional menangkap kura-kura", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01DViCDaHPU4w2ZmuRfAmX95", "content": [{"title": "jage telok buaya permainan tradisional dari kalimantan barat yang meniru kebiasaan buaya", "url": "https://www.goodnewsfromindonesia.id/2026/07/11/jage-telok-buaya-permainan-tradisional-dari-kalimantan-barat-yang-meniru-kebiasaan-buaya"}, {"title": "repository.ubb.ac.id", "url": "https://repository.ubb.ac.id/id/eprint/110/8/Lampiran.pdf"}, {"title": "britannica.com", "url": "https://www.britannica.com/topic/Kubu"}, {"title": "smujo.id", "url": "https://smujo.id/psnmbi/article/download/2605/2271/3442"}, {"title": "journal.ipb.ac.id", "url": "https://journal.ipb.ac.id/j-agrokreatif/article/download/61841/33623/410683"}, {"title": "unmas.ac.id", "url": "https://e-journal.unmas.ac.id/index.php/pemantik/article/download/7420/5624"}, {"title": "ETNOMATEMATIKA PADA ALAT TANGKAP IKAN TRADISIONAL “BUBU”", "url": "https://e-journal.unmas.ac.id/index.php/pemantik/article/view/7420"}, {"title": "menuba ikan tradisi suku dayak tomun yang menggunakan racun akar tuba", "url": "https://www.goodnewsfromindonesia.id/2025/02/05/menuba-ikan-tradisi-suku-dayak-tomun-yang-menggunakan-racun-akar-tuba"}, {"title": "journal.ugm.ac.id", "url": "https://journal.ugm.ac.id/JML/article/download/18517/11810"}]}, "The search didn't turn up anything specific about the tools Suku Kubu people use to catch turtles. The results mostly cover other peoples and other fishing gear.\n\nThe only relevant result is a general Britannica entry on the Kubu. It describes them as indigenous seminomadic forest dwellers found primarily in swampy areas near watercourses in southeastern Sumatra, Indonesia. It also says their food comes mostly from jungle produce and small game, but it does not mention turtles or hunting tools.\n\nThe other results are off-topic. They cover a children's game from West Kalimantan, bubu fish traps used by Aceh and Bali fishermen, and turtle hunting in Papua, none of which concern the Kubu.\n\nA follow-up search in Indonesian, such as \"Orang Rimba berburu kura-kura\" or \"etnografi Suku Anak Dalam alat berburu,\" might find more, since the Kubu are closely related to or often confused with the Suku Anak Dalam (Orang Rimba) of Jambi."], "durationSeconds": 5.435574332999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01RTRBGs8B2j2KJJs54AFHxw", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEQtUTzLtqqHsrRffBph", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_016izaa1b162KPArS3xVb8YZ", "name": "WebSearch", "input": {"query": "Orang Rimba Suku Anak Dalam menangkap kura-kura labi-labi alat", "mode": "standard"}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1131, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4294, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1131}, "output_tokens": 24, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:10:55.341Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEQtUBrq3DD9jcuhdRUo", "wire_tool_inputs": {"toolu_016izaa1b162KPArS3xVb8YZ": {"query": "Orang Rimba Suku Anak Dalam menangkap kura-kura labi-labi alat", "mode": "standard"}}}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_016izaa1b162KPArS3xVb8YZ", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://journal.isi.ac.id/index.php/resital/article/download/489/83\"}, {\"url\": \"https://repository.ipb.ac.id/handle/123456789/121422\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wiki.ubc.ca/Documentation:Open_Case_Studies/FRST522/2022/An_assessment_of_the_fate_of_the_Orang_Rimbo_Indigenous_People_in_Bukit_Dua_Belas_National_Park,_Jambi_Province,_Indonesia:_Power-sharing_or_land_grab%3F\"}, {\"url\": \"https://journal.uinjkt.ac.id/index.php/SOSIO-FITK/article/download/1258/1124\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ejurnal.esaunggul.ac.id/index.php/Formil/article/download/1319/1202\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.aman.or.id/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/Kesaksian-Tumenggung-Tarib_Orang-Rimba_pada-Sidang-Gugatan-UU-Kehutanan-ke-MK-1.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://repository.isi-padangpanjang.ac.id/249/3/BAB%20I.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://journal.ugm.ac.id/kawistara/article/download/6386/5043\"}, {\"url\": \"https://pulitzercenter.org/id/node/27630\"}, {\"url\": \"https://repository.ipb.ac.id/handle/123456789/121422)\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:11:01.474Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Orang Rimba Suku Anak Dalam menangkap kura-kura labi-labi alat", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01MzN5xktA5PeMmVyAtdvk5t", "content": [{"title": "journal.isi.ac.id", "url": "https://journal.isi.ac.id/index.php/resital/article/download/489/83"}, {"title": "IPB University Logo", "url": "https://repository.ipb.ac.id/handle/123456789/121422"}, {"title": "An assessment of the fate of the Orang Rimbo Indigenous People in Bukit Dua Belas National Park, Jambi Province, Indonesia: Power sharing or land grab%3F", "url": "https://wiki.ubc.ca/Documentation:Open_Case_Studies/FRST522/2022/An_assessment_of_the_fate_of_the_Orang_Rimbo_Indigenous_People_in_Bukit_Dua_Belas_National_Park,_Jambi_Province,_Indonesia:_Power-sharing_or_land_grab%3F"}, {"title": "journal.uinjkt.ac.id", "url": "https://journal.uinjkt.ac.id/index.php/SOSIO-FITK/article/download/1258/1124"}, {"title": "esaunggul.ac.id", "url": "https://ejurnal.esaunggul.ac.id/index.php/Formil/article/download/1319/1202"}, {"title": "Kesaksian Tumenggung Tarib Orang Rimba pada Sidang Gugatan UU Kehutanan ke MK 1", "url": "https://www.aman.or.id/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/Kesaksian-Tumenggung-Tarib_Orang-Rimba_pada-Sidang-Gugatan-UU-Kehutanan-ke-MK-1.pdf"}, {"title": "repository.isi-padangpanjang.ac.id", "url": "https://repository.isi-padangpanjang.ac.id/249/3/BAB%20I.pdf"}, {"title": "journal.ugm.ac.id", "url": "https://journal.ugm.ac.id/kawistara/article/download/6386/5043"}, {"title": "Terjemahkan halaman dengan Google", "url": "https://pulitzercenter.org/id/node/27630"}]}, "The search didn't turn up a description of the specific tools Orang Rimba use to catch labi-labi (softshell turtles).\n\nThe most relevant result is an IPB University study on the Anak Dalam (SAD) community in Bukit Duabelas National Park. It reports that hunting was done once a week (42%), and 55% of respondents always succeeded in getting labi-labi. It adds that in one hunting trip people usually caught 2 turtles (50%). The study also found a statistically significant link between respondents' gender and the tool used (chi-square p = 0.044), but the snippet doesn't name the tools themselves. For use, the meat was mainly used for food (63%), and was most often prepared by boiling (60%).\n\nThe same study notes a gap in the literature: studies on SAD's use of turtles have been carried out, but the hunting techniques, especially for turtles, have not been explained in detail. So a detailed account of the tools likely needs the full paper, which I couldn't access here. The IPB repository page (https://repository.ipb.ac.id/handle/123456789/121422) is the place to check."], "durationSeconds": 6.049554374999998, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_016izaa1b162KPArS3xVb8YZ", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
