{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01CfgV7xp1NDeJnmRSs4mYQp", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://repository.ipb.ac.id/handle/123456789/121422\"}, {\"url\": \"https://travel.detik.com/cerita-perjalanan/d-1512401/pertemuan-singkat-dengan-suku-anak-dalam\"}, {\"url\": \"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suku_Anak_Dalam\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/379520506_Aktivitas_Motorik_Suku_Anak_Dalam_Desa_Bukit_Suban_Kecamatan_Air_Hitam_Kabupaten_Sarolangun_Jambi\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/319214660_POLA_DAN_NILAI_LOKAL_ETNIS_DALAM_PEMANFAATAN_SATWA_PADA_ORANG_RIMBA_BUKIT_DUABELAS_PROVINSI_JAMBI\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.rjfahuinib.org/index.php/tabuah/article/download/1313/623\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.berdikarionline.com/sebuah-cerita-dari-suku-anak-dalam/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://desamind.id/2022/06/20/menilik-suku-anak-dalam/\"}, {\"url\": \"http://amrinachipp.blogspot.com/2013/11/karya-ilmiah-tentang-suku-anak-dalam.html\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:11:12.773Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Suku Anak Dalam berburu labi-labi kujur tombak alat tangkap Bukit Duabelas", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01XUyfZQY1hwpWy8MQvLvxGv", "content": [{"title": "Studi Perburuan dan Pemanfaatan Labi-labi (Amyda cartilaginea) oleh Suku Anak Dalam di Taman Nasional Bukit Duabelas", "url": "https://repository.ipb.ac.id/handle/123456789/121422"}, {"title": "Pertemuan Singkat dengan Suku Anak Dalam - detikTravel", "url": "https://travel.detik.com/cerita-perjalanan/d-1512401/pertemuan-singkat-dengan-suku-anak-dalam"}, {"title": "Suku Kubu - Wikipedia bahasa Indonesia, ensiklopedia bebas", "url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suku_Anak_Dalam"}, {"title": "(PDF) Aktivitas Motorik Suku Anak Dalam Desa Bukit Suban, Kecamatan Air Hitam, Kabupaten Sarolangun Jambi", "url": "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/379520506_Aktivitas_Motorik_Suku_Anak_Dalam_Desa_Bukit_Suban_Kecamatan_Air_Hitam_Kabupaten_Sarolangun_Jambi"}, {"title": "(PDF) POLA DAN NILAI LOKAL ETNIS DALAM PEMANFAATAN SATWA PADA ORANG RIMBA BUKIT DUABELAS PROVINSI JAMBI", "url": "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/319214660_POLA_DAN_NILAI_LOKAL_ETNIS_DALAM_PEMANFAATAN_SATWA_PADA_ORANG_RIMBA_BUKIT_DUABELAS_PROVINSI_JAMBI"}, {"title": "Sejarah Sosial dan Kehidupan Ekonomi Suku Anak Dalam ...", "url": "https://www.rjfahuinib.org/index.php/tabuah/article/download/1313/623"}, {"title": "Sebuah Cerita Dari Suku Anak Dalam", "url": "https://www.berdikarionline.com/sebuah-cerita-dari-suku-anak-dalam/"}, {"title": "Menilik Suku Anak Dalam - Desamind", "url": "https://desamind.id/2022/06/20/menilik-suku-anak-dalam/"}, {"title": "Amrina Rosada: karya ilmiah tentang suku anak dalam", "url": "http://amrinachipp.blogspot.com/2013/11/karya-ilmiah-tentang-suku-anak-dalam.html"}]}, "The search turned up a direct study on this, but it doesn't confirm that spears are the turtle-hunting tool.\n\n- **Turtle hunting study:** An IPB repository study of the Asiatic softshell turtle (*Amyda cartilaginea*) in Bukit Duabelas National Park reports that SAD people hunt turtles mainly in the daytime, using a traditional technique called \"tero,\" cited by 69% of respondents. It also found that a single hunt usually yields 2 turtles (50% of respondents). The abstract doesn't say whether \"tero\" is a spear, so I'd check the full text before assuming it is.\n- **Kujur as a spear:** A ResearchGate paper on SAD in Bukit Suban quotes a community member listing tools for hunting: machetes, a spear they call kujur, and homemade firearms, though they sometimes lack access to iron. This confirms kujur is a spear, but the source doesn't tie it to turtle hunting.\n- **Spears in general hunting:** A study of hunting in Bukit Duabelas notes that snares, machetes, bows and spears, and dodeso rope were used in hunting. Another source on the Kubu people says hunts are carried out together with dogs, and the tools used are spears and machetes.\n\nIn short, the sources confirm that SAD use kujur spears and that they hunt turtles, but none of the results explicitly says kujur is the tool for catching labi-labi. The IPB study's \"tero\" is the only documented turtle-specific technique I found."], "durationSeconds": 7.555448334, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01CfgV7xp1NDeJnmRSs4mYQp", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
