{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEQv4MDFFtU5DrcUtbaM", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01HXdiTQ4yHjQU6tbQmzTpHM", "name": "WebSearch", "input": {"query": "\"tero\" labi-labi Suku Anak Dalam alat", "mode": "standard"}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1624, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6705, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1624}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:11:17.049Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEQv475gaWBWiRVW6HFm", "wire_tool_inputs": {"toolu_01HXdiTQ4yHjQU6tbQmzTpHM": {"query": "\"tero\" labi-labi Suku Anak Dalam alat", "mode": "standard"}}}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01HXdiTQ4yHjQU6tbQmzTpHM", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://repository.ipb.ac.id/handle/123456789/121422\"}, {\"url\": \"https://oalib-perpustakaan.upi.edu/Record/repoupi_43231/SMS\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.rjfahuinib.org/index.php/tabuah/article/download/1313/623\"}, {\"url\": \"https://digilib.uin-suka.ac.id/id/eprint/10623/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://cloud.unri.ac.id/direktori/epublicjournals/item?id=21733\"}, {\"url\": \"https://journal.ibrahimy.ac.id/index.php/lisanalhal/article/view/73\"}, {\"url\": \"https://etd.repository.ugm.ac.id/home/detail_pencarian_downloadfiles/232841\"}, {\"url\": \"https://repository.ipb.ac.id/handle/123456789/121421\"}, {\"url\": \"https://digilib.unimed.ac.id/id/eprint/29886/2/proceedings.pdf\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:11:23.207Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"tero\" labi-labi Suku Anak Dalam alat", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01TqnVTf48Q1ddcmaJDgdZfW", "content": [{"title": "IPB University Logo", "url": "https://repository.ipb.ac.id/handle/123456789/121422"}, {"title": "oalib-perpustakaan.upi.edu", "url": "https://oalib-perpustakaan.upi.edu/Record/repoupi_43231/SMS"}, {"title": "www.rjfahuinib.org", "url": "https://www.rjfahuinib.org/index.php/tabuah/article/download/1313/623"}, {"title": "digilib.uin-suka.ac.id", "url": "https://digilib.uin-suka.ac.id/id/eprint/10623/"}, {"title": "cloud.unri.ac.id", "url": "https://cloud.unri.ac.id/direktori/epublicjournals/item?id=21733"}, {"title": "journal.ibrahimy.ac.id", "url": "https://journal.ibrahimy.ac.id/index.php/lisanalhal/article/view/73"}, {"title": "etd.repository.ugm.ac.id", "url": "https://etd.repository.ugm.ac.id/home/detail_pencarian_downloadfiles/232841"}, {"title": "IPB University Logo", "url": "https://repository.ipb.ac.id/handle/123456789/121421"}, {"title": "digilib.unimed.ac.id", "url": "https://digilib.unimed.ac.id/id/eprint/29886/2/proceedings.pdf"}]}, "The search turned up one directly relevant study: an IPB University thesis (Tsabita & Santosa, 2023) on how the Suku Anak Dalam hunt and use the Asiatic softshell turtle (*Amyda cartilaginea*) in Bukit Duabelas National Park.\n\n- **The tool:** In the survey of 40 respondents, the hunters mostly used a *tero* (69%) as their traditional technique. Masyarakat SAD berburu labi-labi di siang hari (63%) dengan teknik tradisional menggunakan tero (69%). That translates to: the SAD usually hunt turtles during the day, using the tero as the traditional method.\n- **Hunting pattern:** The study reports that hunts typically happen once a week, and that the community usually catches about two turtles per hunt. Perburuan dilakukan satu kali seminggu (42%) dan sebanyak 55% dari total responden selalu berhasil mendapatkan labi-labi. Dalam satu kali berburu biasanya masyarakat mendapatkan 2 ekor labi-labi (50%).\n- **Use:** The meat is mainly eaten, most often boiled. Daging labi-labi dimanfaatkan sebagai konsumsi (63%) dan paling banyak diolah dengan cara direbus (60%).\n\nThe abstract does not describe what a tero is physically, so I can't confirm its construction from this source. Based on the context, it is a trap-type device, but that is an inference rather than something the source states. A related IPB study on monitor lizards (result 8) says those were mostly caught with a *jerat* (snare), which is a different tool."], "durationSeconds": 6.098066666999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01HXdiTQ4yHjQU6tbQmzTpHM", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
